                    <img class="tild-img-1 Problems-img" src="/img/muscular-car-service.jpg"
                        alt="a mechanic checking car engine">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row about-features-row">
                <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-6 about-features-col">
                    <div class="about-feature-card">
                        <h6 class="text-uppercase"><strong>Access to 983+ Inventory</strong></h6>
                        <p class="">We are one of the most distinct hubs for buying used engine and used transmission. Our
                            diverse range of used engines for sale is stretched from every Domestic model to Imported one,
                            from Gasoline to diesel. With an expansion of 983+ inventory yards across the USA, we have
                            stocked every make, model, year used engines amd used transmission. What we offer is a
                            customisation of your need with our resources that results in Guaranteed satisfaction.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-feature-card">
                        <h6 class="text-uppercase"><strong>ASE Professional Certified Engines</strong></h6>
                        <p class="">Our work vouches for our Credibility!! The enthusiastic team of Tagore AutoParts has
                            never left any stone unturned in making our customers experience EXCEPTIONAL. Every single used
                            engine and used transmission goes through the quality assessment by the team of ASE certified
                            mechanics. If the ordered engine or transmission doesn't live up to your expectations from the
                            bargain, we additionally give you a 6 months return and replacement warranty.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-feature-card">
                        <h6 class="text-uppercase"><strong>Exclusive Warranty up to 6 months</strong></h6>
                        <p class="">Tagore AutoParts has never shied away from going above and beyond for our clients. We
                            offer an exclusive warranty policy of up to 6 months on our products to provide you an assurance
                            for our AUTHENTICITY. We have tailored a Warranty plan based on the requirements of our
                            customers to offer a straightforward procedure for handling any issues and complaints following
                            a purchase.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-6 about-features-col">
                    <div class="about-feature-card">
                        <h6 class="text-uppercase"><strong>Competent Price</strong></h6>
                        <p class="">We have purposefully priced our high-quality used engines and transmission to take into
                            account the financial element. Our endeavour is to make your purchase as convenient and
                            economical as it could be. You don't have to think twice before placing the order as the
                            UNCOMPROMISED quality product within such IRRESISTABLE price is a RARE combination.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-feature-card">
                        <h6 class="text-uppercase"><strong>Supportive Customer Service</strong></h6>
                        <p class="">Tagore AutoParts thrives upon cultivating long lasting relationships of trust with our
                            customers. Don't burden yourself with any query or slightest hint of doubt, we are here just for
                            YOU. We work with customers and prospects openly, honestly, and sincerely.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-feature-card">
                        <h6 class="text-uppercase"><strong>Returns & Refunds Policy</strong></h6>
                        <p class="">We at Tagore AutoParts have specially crafted 6 months <a href="/terms-and-conditions.html"
                                class="font-bold">return and replacement warranty</a> to take care of any mis happening. We
                            have a dedicated team to look after such matters and provide resolution ASAP. </p>
                        <p class="">Our words are backed by our sincere effort to give you Exceptional service satisfaction.
                            To strengthen our authenticity, we have reviews on Google, by our valuable customers. Just Call
                            us at <a href="tel:+1 888-656-5933" style="display:inline-block; color: #0e8f23;"><strong> <i
                                        class="body-number body-color"> +1 888-656-5933 </i></strong></a> or fill in the <a
                                href="/checkout.html" class="font-bold">form</a> on our website and you will get your used
                            engine or used transmission within the comfort of your place.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <br>
    <br>

    <!-- ##### Why Choose Us Section ##### -->
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-2-8 mb-lg-6">
            <h2 class="display-18 display-md-16 display-lg-14 font-weight-700">Why choose <strong
                    class="text-primary font-weight-700">Us</strong></h2>
            <span>The trusted source for why choose us</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row align-items-center">
